From: Shiny <owner@shinychang.net>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 00:26:58 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat: finish the Shiny rebrand in strings and logos

- Rename every user-visible "Chromium" in chromium_strings.grd,
  settings_chromium_strings.grdp, components_chromium_strings.grd and
  extensions_chromium_strings.grdp, first-run pages included. Legal lines,
  the "Chromium" project link label and "Chromium developers" keep the
  upstream name, since they credit the project rather than name the app.
- Replace the product logos and the first-run illustration tile with the
  Shiny line-art S.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BYkQJUafT3hpFT1kBmDgzX
